# Connected Business philosophy

Canonical lock: `docs/foundations/CONNECTED-BUSINESS.md`

## Core idea

A healthy business, like a healthy body, depends on its systems being **connected and working together**. DigitalGate sells **coherence**, not “another SaaS tool.”

**Proposition:** Connect your business. Give it a brain.  
**Tagline stays:** The Gateway to Your Digital World™

## Evolution

Disconnected → Connected → Intelligent → Autonomous (See → Understand → Decide → Act → Learn).

## Language

Prefer: connect the parts of the business · give it a brain · ability to see / act · shared context.  
Avoid: feature-for-feature vs every silo · “all-in-one” as the whole story · organ emoji as UI.

## Objection

“Why not keep my existing tools?” → Individual tools may be fine; the business is forced to operate as disconnected parts. DigitalGate connects those parts so they work together.

